Voices
------
No voice is included in the add-on. Each voice is downloaded, when you first use it, from
https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices (the Piper voice collection), pinned to one revision.
Each voice has its own licence, shown in the add-on's Settings next to the voice with a link to its
model card. Some voices are free to use for anything (CC0, public domain, CC BY, MIT, Apache 2.0),
some require sharing under the same licence (CC BY-SA, GPL, AGPL), some are for non-commercial use
only (CC BY-NC, CC BY-NC-SA, research-only data), and for some the model card states no licence.
Many voices were fine-tuned from the Lessac voice, whose training data is licensed for research use.
